# Non-blocking reviewer suggestions can be added alongside the enforced
# rules below with a `# suggest: <path-pattern> @user-or-team ...` comment
# line, using the same path-pattern syntax. GitHub's own CODEOWNERS parser
# ignores comment lines, so a `# suggest:` entry can never become a
# required reviewer no matter what branch protection does -- it's requested
# automatically (visible in the Reviewers sidebar) on top of whatever's
# already enforced, via .github/workflows/suggest-reviewers.yml.

